Cell["\<\
The code works as follows:

1) Evaluate the Basic Modules Section. 
2) Evaluate the Standard Model Section. It takes ~\.1d1 s per example \
evaluation.
3) Evaluate the Standard Model with neutrino chemical potentials Section. It \
takes ~2 s per example evaluation.

Note that everything is in MeV Units but the rates, the Hubble parameter and \
time which are in seconds.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.784289428040432*^9, 3.7842894580615473`*^9}, {
  3.7845529786904488`*^9, 3.7845530561184473`*^9}, {3.784553518573971*^9, 
