Cell["\<\
This Section loads the main common Modules: 
\t1) Constants and Parameters 
\t2) Finite Temperature QED corrections 
\t3) Thermodynamic Formulae 
\t4) SM \[Nu]-\[Nu] and \[Nu]-e Interaction Rates
\t
These modules are loaded from BasicModules_v2.m. One can alternatively copy \
the content of BasicModules_v2.nb here and load it locally.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.784289428040432*^9, 3.7842894580615473`*^9}, {
  3.7845529786904488`*^9, 3.7845530561184473`*^9}, {3.784553518573971*^9, 
